ntains a newline \\(U+000A or U+000D\\),\n  and is not surrounded by text on both sides, is removed.\n\n* Other consecutive whitespace is collapsed into a single space \\(U+0020\\).\n\n* HTML character references are decoded into the Unicode characters they represent.\n\nThrows if an invalid character reference is encountered in the text. ","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Html/Syntax.html#Lean.Html.Syntax.TextCommentsView.getText","kind":"def","line":594,"name":"Lean.Html.Syntax.TextCommentsView.getText","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Data/Html/Syntax.lean#L594-L606"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Html/Syntax.html#Lean.Html.Syntax.instBEqTextCommentsView\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Html</span>.<span class=\"name\">Syntax</span>.<span class=\"name\">instBEqTextCommentsView</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BEq\">BEq</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Data/Html/Syntax.html#Lean.Html.Syntax.TextCommentsView\">TextCommentsView</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Html/Syntax.html#Lean.Html.Syntax.instBEqTextCommentsView","kind":"instance","line":592,"name":"Lean.Html.Syntax.instBEqTextCommentsView","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Data/Html/Syntax.lean#L592-L592"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Html/Syntax.html#Lean.Html.Syntax.instBEqTextCommentsView.beq\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Html</span>.<span class=\"name\">Syntax</span>.<span class=\"name\">instBEqTextCommentsView</span>.<span class=\"name\">beq</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_ar